\par\par \b \uc2  Dollar/yen keeps away from highs above 120 yen. \b0\par\par\uc2 246 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 September 2001\par 20:12\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  1808 GMT - Dollar/yen mired below day's peaks, but holds at two-week highs after Japan - in concert with New York Federal Reserve - jumps into market to sell yen lower. Weak stock markets amplify market's dollar bearishness. \par \par \uc2  - Dow Jones falls 53 points, or 0.6 pct. Nasdaq slumps 2.6 pct, off 40 points. \par \par \uc2  - Dollar/yen trades around 119.70 yen , up nearly 1.60 percent on the day but below post-\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  high of 120 yen. Traders seen holding fire to push \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  pair lower amid wariness of further Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Euro/yen slips off highs, but up more than 1 percent on the day, trades at 1-month peaks around 109.90 yen . \par \par \uc2  - Euro/dollar stuck around 91.80 cents , down 0.55 percent on the day. \par \par \uc2  - \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  repeatedly in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets since last week to fend off yen's export-crimping strength, and drafted the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to act on its behalf for third time this week. \par \par \uc2  - Senior Japanese finance ministry official Zembe Mizoguchi said \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in U.S. trading, using the New York Federal Reserve as its agent. NY Fed, however, declines comment. \par \par \uc2  - Market observers note that Japan may attempt to sway U.S. into agreeing to concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at upcoming Group of Seven meeting. With September 11 attacks and ensuing impact on economy, however, many analysts don't expect such efforts to bear fruit. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010927dx9r00yq4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
