\par\par \b \uc2  MoF official says  \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervened \highlight\uc2  through NY Fed. \b0\par\par\uc2 219 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 September 2001\par 15:28\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Sept 27 (Reuters) - Senior Japanese finance ministry official Zenbe Mizoguchi said on Thursday that Japan had just interevened in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, using the New York Federal Reserve bank on its behalf. \par \par \uc2  "Our government has just \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market with the New York Fed acting on its behalf," Mizoguchi, head of the ministry's international bureau, told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  Seperately, a finance ministry official declined to comment onm which \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Japan was buying for the yen. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  had earlier confirmed Japan had sold yen for dollars and euros in both the Asian and European trading sessions on Thursday, making it the sixth day in the last two weeks that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The latest round of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  sent the dollar sharply higher to near 119.80 yen, up some 1.75 percent on the day. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  repeatedly in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets since September 17 to try push the yen lower and has drafted in the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  as its agent on at least three separate occasions, including today. In Frankfurt the ECB declined to comment on this latest round of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  This is the first time in the present round of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  that the New York Fed has been used as agent. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010927dx9r00pn4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
