\par\par \b \uc2  Dollar jumps vs yen as  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  repeats  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 273 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 September 2001\par 13:43\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, Sept 24 (Reuters) - The dollar jumped about a third of a percent against the yen as \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed that it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb yen strength for the second time on Monday. \par \par \uc2  The yen racked up even greater losses against the euro, shedding about half a percent as traders cited talk that the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was also in the market buying euros for yen on behalf of Japan, although the ECB declined to comment. \par \par \uc2  The euro's gains against the yen pushed it to the day's highs against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Japan's top financial diplomat Haruhiko Kuroda said \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  was conducting \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in appropriate \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  which was not limited to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  "There were rumours of ECB \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and we saw euro/dollar shoot up. The ECB has said it has no comment. We saw euro/yen jump up first so it could be them on behalf of the Bank of Japan," said Neil Parker, market strategist at RBS Financial Markets. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  earlier in European trade. The yen has risen five percent against the dollar since the attacks on the United States a fortnight ago and Japan is worried a strong yen will harm an already frail domestic economy. \par \par \uc2  AT 1128 GMT the dollar was trading around 117.35 yen up from levels around 117 just before \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The euro also firmed about half a percent on the yen and was trading around 107.65 yen. \par \par \uc2  The dollar fell briefly to the day's lows around $0.9200 cents per euro before trimming gains to around $0.9175 . \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010924dx9o00o34\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
